<title>UK: KFW adds 250 million marks to December 2003 bond.</title>
<headline>KFW adds 250 million marks to December 2003 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 750 million marks from 500 million marks, lead manager DG Bank said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KREDITANSTALT FUER WEIDERAUFBAU</p>
<p> AMT   *750 MLN DEM   COUPON   **4.125     MATURITY    05.DEC.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  102.0     PAY DATE    05.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.25	LISTING    FFURT     PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> NOTES     *LAUNCHED ORIGINALLY FOR 500 MILLION MARKS ON</p>
<p>		14.FEB.97</p>
<p>	    **TILL 05.DEC.97 THEN IF NOT CALLED AT PAR STEPS-UP TO</p>
<p>		5.40 PCT.</p>
<p>		NEW ISSUE PRICE.</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    MGT/UND    0.75	SELL CONC   1.50</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
